(text "PWR1/PWR0: 00 Sprint (start4.68V); 01 extended (start5.58V); 10 full (start7.96V); 11 fault.\nModes latch on delayed ARM edge and reset to Sprint on fault. Changing PWR while armed does not change rail;\nchanging to11 still faults. Retuning/I2C, stopped heartbeat, MUTE low, UV/OV/OC/hot/open NTC clear ARMED.\nRearm: ARM low >=20ms, health stable + I2C quiet, requests/mode fixed; ARM high then wait >=250ms beforefirstKEY.\nNo auto-rearm after fault with ARM stuck high. Verify asynchronous recovery/Schmitt delay with real parts." (at 15 245 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "15dca680-d35a-5f1f-b181-0b7184d2c014"))
